  "linkLines": [
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 40s, with calloused knuckles looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 40s, with calloused knuckles looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 40s, with calloused knuckles says. (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "\"Hey.\" A person, maybe 30s settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A person, maybe 30s.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "You remember the Bow at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "\"The sick need tending — triage tents, broth, boiled water. Or we tighten our belts and wait it out. Or the hale hunt while the sick lie still.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "🔥 “I don’t say this lightly.” Nathan sets their bowl down. “Liam, your trade story isn’t true, is it? I’ve heard enough versions now.” Nobody looks at Liam. Everybody does."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "“You’re right.” Liam doesn’t look up. “I wasn’t veterinarian. I was farmer. I’m sorry — I wanted a cleaner story than I had.” The fire lets it land. Someone passes Liam the bowl without a word."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A man, maybe 40s, with a crooked nose looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A woman, maybe 60s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 50s says. (Trust too low.)"
    },
