  "linkLines": [
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Deep Read! You don't just read trust — you read intent. Know what they'll do next. (Your knowledge of Reading People amplifies your open_book.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "📖 LEARNED: Generous Heart (Level 1). Donating gives 2x trust."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "You wake up with dirt in your mouth and blood on your hands that isn't yours. The sky is the wrong color — not sunset-wrong, wound-wrong. Wyatt Tkachenko. Bartender. From Columbus, Ohio. That was yesterday. This is now. You have: Trail compass, Knife roll, Seed packet, Photo album, Mixtape. That's everything you own in this world. Haven. Twelve people. The fire is lit. Last night, something walked"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a broad frame looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a broad frame looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a broad frame looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "🍲 A woman, maybe 30s, with weathered hands eats with A person, maybe 40s — bowls side by side, talk low."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "\"Hey.\" A woman, maybe 30s, with weathered hands settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A woman, maybe 30s, with weathered hands.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "You caught the lie in his face and watched the whole table react to it before he'd finished the sentence. Face and room, both open books."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 60s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A man, maybe 40s, with ink-stained fingers shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "Aisling shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "Oliver is staying at Haven as the camp healer now — tending the sick instead of ranging out."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "Aisling shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "Guoliang looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A woman, maybe 30s, with a gap-toothed grin hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A woman, maybe 30s, with a shaved head shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "“You’re right.” Marco doesn’t look up. “I wasn’t Denver. I was Columbus, Ohio. I’m sorry — I wanted a cleaner story than I had.” The fire lets it land. Someone passes Marco the bowl without a word."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "🍲 Marco eats quiet by the fire, scraping the bowl clean with their thumb."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "🍽️ Arjun stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "Aisling hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "Guoliang shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "Aisling hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "🍲 Aisling is hunched over their bowl by the fire, eating like it matters."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
