      "line": "💛 You hold Boot stone. You carry a guilt like a stone in the boot. So you carry a stone in the boot — the scattering took the one person you were keeping alive, and this is the shape of that. It keeps you honest. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they know your hands. The feast was the weapon."
    },
    {
      "day": 109,
      "line": "You sow Blackberry: 180 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 109,
      "line": "🍲 Diana eats quiet by the fire, scraping the bowl clean with their thumb."
    },
    {
      "day": 109,
      "line": "🍽️ Theo stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\""
    },
