    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "📺 Dilnaz killed The Heckler out past the ridge — with Eamon charging in when it turned — and walked home. 6 rounds, 17 taken. (The village watches the broadcast. Nobody blinks.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "⛓️ Dilnaz brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Dilnaz speaks at Stonebridge's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "Three weeks. That's how long before a handshake is a relationship — the System will say so when it's true. Tend this fire."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "📓 Codex: First link formed with Stonebridge. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "The System's overlay stretches — new edges, new names. Coordination layer: warming up. It'll be ready when the bond is."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "📓 Codex: The first accord: Haven bound to Stonebridge. The village felt it."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "🍽️ Desmond weighs the day's basket against the pantry shelves and puts it down. \"Enough. Carving bowls instead — we're down to the cracked ones.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1500 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 11,
      "line": "Sanne leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Murkcap. Stay out of the sporefall. The spores only drift so far and sink in still air. When the gills start breathing, back off and let the cloud settle — then move in while it recovers. Never stand downwind of a breathing cap.\""
    },
