      "line": "🌪️ THE HERALD struck Stonebridge in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 104,
      "line": "No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."
    },
    {
      "day": 104,
      "line": "💛 You hold Knife roll. The dinner rush, the pass, the tickets coming faster than thought. You survived your first Saturday service at sixteen. The roll was the prize. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they know your hands. The feast was the weapon."
    },
    {
      "day": 104,
      "line": "Martha hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 104,
      "line": "🌙 Night. The lingering Big-Eyes gorges at the treeline — 1,000 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk."
    },
    {
      "day": 104,
      "line": "🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 105,
      "line": "💛 You hold Knife roll. The dinner rush, the pass, the tickets coming faster than thought. You survived your first Saturday service at sixteen. The roll was the prize. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they have carried you this far. The feast was the weapon."
    },
    {
      "day": 105,
      "line": "🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 105,
      "line": "🌾 Tribute wagons from Ashford turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 105,
      "line": "🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"
    }
