    {
      "day": 90,
      "line": "🏃 Yuki of Emberhold walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Emberhold has grain to spare — 2,601 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""
    },
    {
