      "day": 10,
      "line": "🔥 The fire settles. Jamal has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"White Noise — I put it down today.\" \"The heron is gone. No — it's there. It was always there. You just couldn't see it until it moved.\" \"You blink. It is somewhere else. You didn't see it move.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Rosa says quietly \"The fire feels smaller now.\" Guadalupe says \"T"
