    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "⛓️ Jamal brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Jamal speaks at Emberhold's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "Three weeks. That's how long before a handshake is a relationship — the System will say so when it's true. Tend this fire."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons."
