      "line": "No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "\"Hey.\" A woman, maybe 20s settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A woman, maybe 20s.)"
    },
