      "line": "Najat hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 87,
      "line": "No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."
    },
    {
      "day": 87,
      "line": "💛 You hold Dispatcher's headset. You learned the voice — low, steady, unhurried. 'Panic is just information arriving too fast.' You hear it in your own voice now when it counts. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they have carried you this far. The feast was the weapon."
    },
    {
      "day": 87,
      "line": "🗣️ Kobchai to Miguel, by the fire: \"The table's set. The ring of pale light — it's just sitting there. Waiting on them. What do you think they'll tell it?\""
    }
  ],
