      "line": "🍽️ Aroha weighs the day's basket against the pantry shelves and puts it down. \"Enough. Carving bowls instead — we're down to the cracked ones.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 78,
      "line": "\"The sick need tending — triage tents, broth, boiled water. Or we tighten our belts and wait it out. Or the hale hunt while the sick lie still.\""
